WEBVTT

1
00:00:07.085 --> 00:00:12.347
Long, long ago, a mole couple's daughter, Mollie, was ready to marry.

2
00:00:13.207 --> 00:00:17.188
In the mole village, Moler was the best available bridegroom.

3
00:00:17.888 --> 00:00:22.289
However, Father Mole and Mother Mole were not satisfied with him.

4
00:00:22.309 --> 00:00:26.731
"Isn't there a better bridegroom?"

5
00:00:27.491 --> 00:00:28.591
asked Mollie's mother.

6
00:00:28.611 --> 00:00:33.212
"Our Mollie must marry the greatest bridegroom," said her father.

7
00:00:34.053 --> 00:00:36.813
Father Mole and Mother Mole discussed the matter.

8
00:00:36.833 --> 00:00:41.094
"Who do you think is the greatest of all?"

9
00:00:41.715 --> 00:00:43.095
Father wondered aloud.

10
00:00:43.115 --> 00:00:47.956
"I think the sun is the greatest," Mother answered.

11
00:00:49.077 --> 00:00:50.697
Father Mole went to the sun.

12
00:00:50.717 --> 00:00:54.398
"Gosh! It's so hot!

13
00:00:55.258 --> 00:00:57.459
Sun, are you the greatest of all?"

14
00:00:58.539 --> 00:00:59.119
he asked.

15
00:01:00.020 --> 00:01:01.200
"No, I'm not.

16
00:01:01.640 --> 00:01:05.683
When the cloud comes and covers me, I can't even show my face.

17
00:01:06.364 --> 00:01:09.506
The cloud is the greatest," the sun replied.

18
00:01:09.527 --> 00:01:11.308
"Oh, I see.

19
00:01:11.708 --> 00:01:12.169
Thank you."

20
00:01:14.110 --> 00:01:16.092
Father Mole went to see the cloud.

21
00:01:16.112 --> 00:01:18.674
"Oh my, it's so dark!

22
00:01:19.495 --> 00:01:21.836
Cloud, are you the greatest of all?"

23
00:01:22.237 --> 00:01:22.777
he asked.

24
00:01:23.718 --> 00:01:24.519
"No, I'm not.

25
00:01:25.119 --> 00:01:27.721
When the wind comes, I'm blown away in seconds.

26
00:01:28.342 --> 00:01:30.984
The wind is the greatest," replied the cloud.

27
00:01:31.700 --> 00:01:32.801
"Oh, I see.

28
00:01:33.241 --> 00:01:33.701
Thank you."

29
00:01:35.221 --> 00:01:37.022
Father Mole went to see the wind.

30
00:01:37.042 --> 00:01:40.664
"Oh my, I'm about to be blown away!

31
00:01:41.504 --> 00:01:44.385
Wind, you are the greatest of all, right?"

32
00:01:45.326 --> 00:01:46.446
he asked hopefully.

33
00:01:46.466 --> 00:01:49.047
"No, I'm not.

34
00:01:49.687 --> 00:01:54.889
There is someone who doesn't blow away even when I blow my hardest," said the wind.

35
00:01:54.909 --> 00:01:56.430
"Is that true?"

36
00:01:56.970 --> 00:01:57.991
asked Father Mole.

37
00:01:58.011 --> 00:02:05.067
"Mr. Mole, if you are looking for the greatest, go to the Buddha statue," advised the wind.

38
00:02:07.089 --> 00:02:11.212
Though Father Mole was tired, he went to see the Buddha statue.

39
00:02:11.232 --> 00:02:13.274
"Finally I've found it.

40
00:02:14.155 --> 00:02:17.618
Buddha statue, you are the greatest in the world, right?"

41
00:02:18.318 --> 00:02:19.439
Father Mole asked.

42
00:02:20.860 --> 00:02:22.121
"No, I'm not.

43
00:02:22.802 --> 00:02:28.527
If a mole dug a hole under my feet, I could not stand for even a minute," the

44
00:02:28.567 --> 00:02:29.928
Buddha statue answered.

45
00:02:31.948 --> 00:02:35.330
"Do you think the mole is the best bridegroom in the world?"

46
00:02:35.890 --> 00:02:36.951
asked Father Mole.

47
00:02:36.971 --> 00:02:39.932
"Definitely! Ha-ha-ha!"

48
00:02:39.952 --> 00:02:42.514
the Buddha statue answered with laughter.

49
00:02:45.475 --> 00:02:48.157
Father Mole then went back to the mole village.

50
00:02:48.177 --> 00:02:54.620
"Honey! I've found someone who is the greatest," he declared to his wife.

51
00:02:54.640 --> 00:02:56.281
"Oh really!"

52
00:02:57.022 --> 00:02:57.882
Mother replied.

53
00:02:59.383 --> 00:03:00.784
Father Mole explained.

54
00:03:01.408 --> 00:03:03.549
"The sun said, 'The cloud is the greatest.'

55
00:03:04.229 --> 00:03:06.409
The cloud said, 'The wind is the greatest.'

56
00:03:07.070 --> 00:03:09.710
The wind said, 'The Buddha statue is the greatest.'

57
00:03:10.390 --> 00:03:13.531
And then I found out who is the greatest of all."

58
00:03:13.551 --> 00:03:15.992
"Who is that?"

59
00:03:16.692 --> 00:03:17.832
Mother Mole asked.

60
00:03:18.533 --> 00:03:20.473
"It is one of us, the moles!"

61
00:03:20.493 --> 00:03:27.975
"Well, then, we must choose the best bridegroom from among the greatest moles," Mother replied.

62
00:03:30.056 --> 00:03:34.321
As a result, Father Mole and Mother Mole met with Moler.

63
00:03:35.022 --> 00:03:37.465
Soon, Mollie and Moler were married.

64
00:03:38.386 --> 00:03:41.911
Couldn't the greatest in the world be right next to you?
